      {
        "id": 91307,
        "name": "Envisioner",
        "username": "Envisioner",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-15T03:08:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"jsz2\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n jsz2:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'm not familiar with the term \"clockwork cosmos\". &nbsp;Would you be so kind as to expound upon your meaning?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It means that all reality operates with the precision of an incredibly vast and cosmic machine, with every atom a \"gear\" in this vast \"clock\", so that nothing is ever truly random, but rather the deterministic effect of a hugely long and complex chain of cause and effect.</p>",
