      {
        "id": 91310,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-15T06:20:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm not sure. &nbsp;Statistics defined by the nature of randomness, so discussing the nature of randomness isn't necessarily out of place in a statistics thread.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That being said, if we devolve into discussing whether our topic is on topic then we will definately be off topic, and then we will have to be moved to another thread which is solely focused on discussing whether this thread is on topic. &nbsp;</p>",
